From 0b4c5f7bc62495c6eb171a0257ee6944fae86982 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Potin Lai <potin.lai@quantatw.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Feb 2026 18:21:43 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] queued-boot-progress: update 49527530a5..0a5ef0dafc

Sync queued-boot-progress related changes in Core-26.01-2_br [1] from Nvidia phosphor-host-postd repo.

Curtis Chuang (1):
      queued-boot-progress: fix queue overflow flooding post-code log

Prithvi Pai (6):
      Performance Issue with registering USB devices
      Add CAK initialization state tracking via POST code filtering
      Refactor USB hotplug handling
      queued-boot-progress: Vera I2C recovery after incomplete F1
      queued-boot-progress: improve debugability logging
      reopen I2C before discard after F1 failure

[1] https://github.com/NVIDIA/phosphor-host-postd/commit/0a5ef0dafc8f4c09fa386a4276be8822739204eb
